<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.png">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main>
        <section class="section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <h2>Documentation</h2>
                    <p>Everything you need to know about RoIron</p>
                </div>

                <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
                    <div style="background: #1a1a1a; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                        <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2C12 2 8 6 8 12C8 15 10 18 12 20C14 18 16 15 16 12C16 6 12 2 12 2Z"/><path d="M12 9C10.3431 9 9 10.3431 9 12C9 13.6569 10.3431 15 12 15C13.6569 15 15 13.6569 15 12C15 10.3431 13.6569 9 12 9Z"/><path d="M8 12H4"/><path d="M20 12H16"/><path d="M12 8V4"/><path d="M12 20V16"/></svg>
                            Getting Started
                        </h3>
                        <p style="color: #888888; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
                            RoIron is a lightweight Roblox enhancement tool. After installing the extension,
                            navigate to <code>https://www.roblox.com/roiron</code>
                            to activate your license and start using all features.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div style="background: #1a1a1a; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                        <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L4 5V12C4 16.5 7 20.5 12 22C17 20.5 20 16.5 20 12V5L12 2Z"/><path d="M9 12L11 14L15 10"/></svg>
                            License Activation
                        </h3>
                        <p style="color: #888888; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
                            To activate RoIron, you need a valid license key. Visit
                            <code>https://www.roblox.com/roiron</code>
                            and enter your license key. You will be redirected to the home page upon successful activation.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div style="background: #1a1a1a; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                        <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2C12 6 16 8 16 12C16 16 12 18 12 22"/><path d="M12 2C12 6 8 8 8 12C8 16 12 18 12 22"/><path d="M4 8H20"/><path d="M4 16H20"/></svg>
                            Theme Creator
                        </h3>
                        <p style="color: #888888; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
                            RoIron includes a powerful Theme Creator. Click the paint palette icon in the sidebar
                            to open the editor. You can pick any element on the page and customize its styles:
                            colors, sizes, spacing, borders, and more. Changes are applied globally.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div style="background: #1a1a1a; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                        <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4H16L20 8V20H4V4Z"/><path d="M12 8V13M9 11H15"/></svg>
                            Keyboard Shortcuts
                        </h3>
                        <ul style="color: #888888; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2; padding-left: 20px;">
                            <li><kbd style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #ffffff;">Alt</kbd> + <kbd style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #ffffff;">R</kbd> — Open RoIron home page</li>
                            <li><kbd style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #ffffff;">Alt</kbd> + <kbd style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #ffffff;">S</kbd> — Open RoIron settings</li>
                            <li><kbd style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #ffffff;">Alt</kbd> + <kbd style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #ffffff;">L</kbd> — Go to license activation page</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div style="background: #1a1a1a; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;">
                        <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4a9eff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 4H18V8C18 10 17 12 15 13.5C13.5 15 12 15.5 12 15.5C12 15.5 10.5 15 9 13.5C7 12 6 10 6 8V4Z"/><path d="M6 4H4V7C4 8.5 5 9.5 6 10"/><path d="M18 4H20V7C20 8.5 19 9.5 18 10"/><path d="M12 15.5V20"/><path d="M9 20H15"/></svg>
                            Leaderboards
                        </h3>
                        <p style="color: #888888; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
                            RoIron tracks your XP, level, and playtime. Compete with other users on the leaderboards
                            and see how you rank. Your activity is tracked automatically when you play Roblox games.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
